      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.04,
      "end_seconds": 39.07,
      "duration_seconds": 12.03,
      "text": "it's moderate, honestly. Only a cold compress, and it's not much. I've had a sticky discharge in the morning too, for about a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
