      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.03,
      "end_seconds": 142.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "and foreign body in the eye, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.74,
      "end_seconds": 147.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Definitely no foreign body in the eye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.13,
      "end_seconds": 155.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "Right, right. Have you had any sensitivity to light, cold or pain in the eye?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.0,
      "end_seconds": 165.04,
      "duration_seconds": 9.04,
      "text": "Uh, no sensitivity to light, cold or pain in the eye, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.57,
      "end_seconds": 172.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.96,
      "end_seconds": 177.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Erm, bowels are regular, nothing odd."
